## What's interactive in this mockup

| Interaction | Behavior |
|---|---|
| **Click any task** (sidebar OR card) | Opens detail panel, highlights both sidebar row + kanban card simultaneously |
| **Click same task again** | Deselects and closes detail panel |
| **ESC key** | Closes detail panel or any open modal |
| **Detail panel content** | Dynamically populated per task — description, meta grid, subtasks (with done state), files, messages, activity log |
| **Move button** | Opens move modal, selecting a column enables confirm, updates the column badge in the panel |
| **+ Subtask button** | Opens task modal pre-filled as "Add Subtask" with parent context note |
| **Sidebar search** | Filters sidebar rows + hides empty column groups |
| **Column filter pills** | Shows/hides column groups in sidebar |
| **Sidebar collapse** | Collapses to icon-only mode |
| **New Board / Column modals** | Fully functional form modals with color picker |

