## 9. Subtask Behavior

**Core rule:** Subtasks are **flat independent cards** in the board — no visual nesting hierarchy is shown.

Creating a subtask:
- Via sidebar task row "Sub" hover button
- Via kanban card "Sub" hover button
- Via detail panel "+ " button next to Subtasks section
- Via input area code-branch button
- Via New Task modal (pre-filled as subtask with parent name shown)

The New Task modal shows an info note: *"Subtasks appear as flat independent cards. No nested hierarchy is shown in the board."*

