```

## Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|----------|-----------|
| **Flat subtask model** | Subtasks shown as `parentId` reference, no nested tree in canvas |
| **`activeColumnFilter` in parent** | Single source of truth – sidebar pills + canvas columns both react |
| **Drag-drop in `KanbanBoardColumn`** | Isolated per-column drag state, emits `move-task` upward |
| **Modals via `ref` + `openX()` methods** | Clean imperative API without prop drilling boolean flags |
| **Search in sidebar only** | Filters `sidebarTasks` computed, canvas always shows full column view |
| **Existing `TaskCard`** | Reuses the proven card component, no duplication |
| **`modal` component** | Uses existing DaisyUI-wrapped `<modal>` as in `Kanban.vue` |

