### Architecture after this change

```
$storex.kanban                         ← single source of truth for all board state
  ├── state:    activeBoard, filter, loadingChats
  ├── getters:  kanban, allBoards, boardChats, viewColumns, columnList,
  │             childBoards, parentBoard, lastUpdatedTask, isLoading
  ├── mutations: setActiveBoard, setFilter, incrementLoading, decrementLoading
  └── actions:  loadKanban, saveKanban, setActiveBoard,
                addColumn, updateColumn, deleteColumn, syncColumnOrder,
                moveTask, newTask, createSubTask,
                addBoard, saveBoard, deleteBoard, toggleBookmark

KanbanContainer.vue  →  shows KanbanList OR KanbanView (no logic)
KanbanView.vue       →  toolbar + grid/files views, modals (UI only)
KanbanGridView.vue   →  unchanged, receives viewColumns as prop
