---

## 4. Summary of All Root Causes Fixed

| # | Root Cause | Fix Applied |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | **`kanban.js` `allBoards` getter crashed** on `null` board entries (e.g. `"Folder Names..."` is `null` in kanban.json) | Added `.filter(title => boards[title] !== null)` |
| 2 | **`KanbanContainer` used `$projects` store** for kanban operations while the new architecture uses `$kanban` store | All kanban reads/writes now go through `$kanban` |
| 3 | **`project` watcher fired too broadly** — any reactive change re-triggered `projectChanged` | Added `codx_path` comparison guard |
| 4 | **`boards` computed in Container** did raw `Object.keys()` bypassing store nulls/transforms | Now uses `$kanban.allBoards` which handles null entries |
| 5 | **`kanban.js` `addBoard`** assumed `kanban.boards` always existed | Added `if (!kanban.boards) kanban.boards = {}` guard |
| 6 | **`deleteBoard` fallback** could select a null board key | Fixed to `find(k => kanban.boards[k] !== null)` |

